@page 54 morning-prayer
c __MORNING PRAYER.__
  praise him, and magnify him for ever.
P O ye Ice and Snow, bless ye the Lord: praise
  him, and magnify him for ever.
P O ye Nights and Days, bless ye the Lord:
  praise him, and magnify him for ever.
P O ye Light and Darkness, bless ye the Lord:
  praise him, and magnify him for ever.
P O ye Lightnings and Clouds, bless ye the
  Lord: praise him, and magnify him for ever.
P O let the Earth bless the Lord: yea, let it
  praise him, and magnify him for ever.
P O ye Mountains and Hills, bless ye the Lord:
  praise him, and magnify him for ever.
P O all ye Green things upon the earth, bless ye
  the Lord: praise him, and magnify him for ever.
P O ye Wells, bless ye the Lord: praise him,
  and magnify him for ever.
P O ye Seas and Floods, bless ye the Lord:
  praise him, and magnify him for ever.
P O ye Whales, and all that move in the wa-
  ters, bless ye the Lord: praise him, and mag-
  nify him for ever.
P O all ye Fowls of the air, bless ye the Lord:
  praise him, and magnify him for ever.
P O all ye Beasts and Cattle, bless ye the Lord:
  praise him, and magnify him for ever.
P O ye Children of men, bless ye the Lord:
  praise him, and magnify him for ever.
P O let Israel bless the Lord: praise him, and
  magnify him for ever.
f O
